[color=#F5F8FA]MENU[/color]
• Added a focused Home hub.
• Added working Play and Heroes tabs.
• Added selected hero splash art and mode selection.

[color=#F5F8FA]ONLINE[/color]
• Added Quick Match diagnostics and clearer EOS errors.

[color=#F5F8FA]COMBAT UI[/color]
• Improved health, mana, status, and ability displays.

[color=#9DAAB5]This page is kept in the menu scene for now. Move it to data only when patch notes need frequent updates.[/color]"
fit_content = true

